WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.820
Justin Warner here,
the man with the fans.

00:00:02.820 --> 00:00:04.620
And in order to get in
the spirit, my friends,

00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:06.510
check it out.

00:00:06.510 --> 00:00:07.560
How cool is that?

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:10.890
These are the Black Panther
claws produced by Hasbro.

00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:13.830
And they're really putting
me in the spirit of things.

00:00:13.830 --> 00:00:16.379
You can show off your
fiercest Wakandan salute.

00:00:16.379 --> 00:00:17.350
You got lights.

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:18.360
You got actions.

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:20.520
And man, that sounds sharp.

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:23.130
Speaking of sharp, I'm
over here with Brandon.

00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:24.870
And Brandon, you're
looking mighty good.

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:26.190
Thanks, Justin.

00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:27.450
Thank you, man.

00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:29.520
So I understand you're a
huge Black Panther fan.

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:30.810
And I got to know.

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:33.110
Can you tell us a little bit
about your cosplay tonight?

00:00:33.110 --> 00:00:33.910
Of course.

00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:36.840
So what I'm actually
wearing is King Azzuri,

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:39.760
who is the grandfather
of King T'Challa.

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:40.560
Wow.

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:42.480
So you got the whole family
lineage and everything.

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:42.720
Yeah.

00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:44.220
Eventually, I'm going
to do King T'Chaka

00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:45.870
too, along with Black Panther.

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:47.910
So as a Black Panther
fan, I got to know.

00:00:47.910 --> 00:00:51.300
What inspires you from the film?

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:55.350
Really, what inspires me most
is the end scene where Wakanda

00:00:55.350 --> 00:00:57.570
finally makes the
decision to open up

00:00:57.570 --> 00:01:01.320
its borders to the world, to
share technology because unity,

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:03.360
I feel like, is what
it's all about--

00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:05.250
working together
with other nations,

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:06.780
working with other
cultures and stuff.

00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:08.730
And I love what
Marvel and Disney--

00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:11.010
how they're incorporating
more and more cultures,

00:01:11.010 --> 00:01:13.830
setting the tone that
we as African-Americans

00:01:13.830 --> 00:01:15.970
and people of color
had never seen before.

00:01:15.970 --> 00:01:17.490
So this is
groundbreaking for me.

00:01:17.490 --> 00:01:19.050
So we chatted a
little bit before.

00:01:19.050 --> 00:01:20.670
And I think it's
not just important

00:01:20.670 --> 00:01:23.680
for people of our age, but for
the next generation, as well.

00:01:23.680 --> 00:01:25.770
And I understand that you
have a little cosplayer

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:26.820
waiting for you at home.

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:28.650
Yes, my son Braxton.

00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:30.360
We love doing cosplay together.

00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:31.630
I love dressing up.

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:33.150
He loves dressing up with me.

00:01:33.150 --> 00:01:35.040
And we go to cons
and stuff like that.

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:36.450
We have so much fun together.

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:38.250
Well, Braxton, my
friend, it's your lucky day

00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:40.590
because in partner with Hasbro,
we're handing out the Marvel

00:01:40.590 --> 00:01:43.770
Legends Black Panther
premium electronic helmet

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:46.600
and Black Panther
Wakanda FX battle claws.

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:47.400
Awesome.

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:48.840
That's awesome.

00:01:48.840 --> 00:01:49.690
Thanks, Marvel.

00:01:49.690 --> 00:01:52.470
Yeah, right
there for you, man.

00:01:52.470 --> 00:01:53.940
Hot diggity dog.

00:01:53.940 --> 00:01:56.010
Today is a good day.

00:01:56.010 --> 00:01:58.270
And for all of you at
home, you can, of course,

00:01:58.270 --> 00:02:00.000
get your Black
Panther Wakanda battle

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:04.210
FX claws at your local Target,
Walmart, or online at Amazon.

00:02:04.210 --> 00:02:05.520
And I just got to know.

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:08.580
I wonder, do you think Hasbro
makes a set of matching abs?

00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:11.070
Man, I hope they do
make a set of matching abs

00:02:11.070 --> 00:02:12.180
because I got dad bod.

00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:13.950
So little matching
abs that go with this,

00:02:13.950 --> 00:02:15.870
Hasbro, if you
have it, I need it.

00:02:15.870 --> 00:02:17.900
I need it.

